{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","萨忒娜"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名天真烂漫的祈火者，能够承担大量伤害，降低敌人的受愈并且造成持续伤害。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","让战场燃起来吧！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","All is known to me except for myself."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","我想跳支舞来庆祝！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Oh, I want to leap and dance with joy!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","欣赏灵火之舞吧！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Savour the flickering flames!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","稍事休息吧……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Dark prophecies should not be remembered..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","为我倾倒了吗？"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Heheh, I want to become as strong as Antandra!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","我猜，这儿有人想与我共舞一曲？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","辉煌的灵火啊，荡漾的流言啊，都将祝福着你，旅人。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","灵火银杯，流言交融，舞之道之，天然歌颂。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","還不來吧。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这是命运的垂青吗？！你果然很会挑礼物！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","嗯……很漂亮，但它真的……适合我吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","有人想跳舞吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","开心一些吧！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","来一点蜂蜜蛋糕吧？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","好美的彩缎！还有雪花！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","在雪中跳舞吧！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","像火焰一样热烈！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","去看美丽的烟花吧！"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","萨忒娜肢体柔软，能做出许多高难度动作，小时候曾在街头表演杂耍讨生活。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","萨忒娜预言时，偶尔会进入没有知觉的状态，说出自己也难以预料到的话语。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","萨忒娜曾预言出顾客的厄运，那人生气了没付钱，后来那人真的遭了厄运，同预言中说的一样。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","萨忒娜占卜的准确率大致在7成上下，但她会自信满满地表示自己的占卜百分百正确。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","萨忒娜十分害怕毛茸茸的巨大物体，据说她小时候曾被沙漠中正体不明的野兽当作猎物追逐许久。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","安丹德拉给了萨忒娜第二次人生，萨忒娜想占卜其命运作为回报，却占卜出了极坏的结果，这让她非常忧虑。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","萨忒娜的舞技十分了得，能够控制手脚上的饰物发出敲击声的节奏。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","比起舞技，萨忒娜的歌喉就略逊一筹，她常思索这是否就是呼唤神明不是每次都有回应的理由。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","萨忒娜的生活无时无刻离不开预示和感召，她会因为风儿将叶子吹向左侧而选择左边的路，也会因为太阳不够耀眼而拒绝出门，说那代表未来黯淡。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","据说，萨忒娜有一套自己的养生方法，曾有人目睹她倒挂在树上睡觉。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","对了对了，有件事我一直没问呢，之前偷走我项链的小偷到底是谁？"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412010.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","萨忒娜 & 漫漫 & 瓦尔克"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","风蚀飞地"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","深红高原"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","嗯？想问我项链的事情吗，你说的是这条骨质项链，对吧？"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412030.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","萨忒娜"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","风蚀飞地"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","深红高原"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","萨忒娜，你的预言能力好厉害，究竟是怎么做到的呢？是一种魔法吗？"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412040.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 萨忒娜"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","风蚀飞地"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","深红高原"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","有人说，要把趁手的好枪当做恋人。"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412110.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","瓦尔克 & 漫漫 & 萨忒娜"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","风蚀飞地"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","深红高原"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","索恩，坐下好好休息吧，已经走了一天，应该很疲劳了。"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412120.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","安丹德拉 & 索恩 & 萨忒娜"],["/interaction_records/4/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","风蚀飞地"],["/interaction_records/4/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","深红高原"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","萨忒娜，能不能帮我占卜……"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412140.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","瓦尔克 & 萨忒娜"],["/interaction_records/5/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","风蚀飞地"],["/interaction_records/5/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","深红高原"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","等一下，你不能拿走我的水壶，那里面可是我从集市淘换来的好水，一点沙子都没掺。"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412150.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","阿德 & 满满 & 瓦尔克 & 萨忒娜"],["/interaction_records/6/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","风蚀飞地"],["/interaction_records/6/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","深红高原"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","有人想跳舞吗？"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415096.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","萨忒娜"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","来一点蜂蜜蛋糕吧？"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415097.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","萨忒娜"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","好美的彩缎！还有雪花！"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415405.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","萨忒娜"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","在雪中跳舞吧！"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415406.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","萨忒娜"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","嗯哼哼——哼哼——这个调子不错吧？